    "detailed_description": "Strap in and blast through time in TimeFixers, a pulse-pounding roguelike where history\u2019s fate is in your hands. Rogue robots are wreaking havoc across the ages, and it\u2019s up to you to stop them before they tear the timeline to shreds.<br><br>As a TimeFixer, you\u2019re armed to the teeth with outrageous abilities and weapons, tearing through epochs from Ancient Egypt to a wild, futuristic cosmos. Smash through enemy hordes, topple ruthless robot overlords, and snag the vital time keys to stitch the timeline back together. With each run, face new challenges and power up in ways that\u2019ll keep you on your toes \u2013 no two runs are ever the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/3c1e1ecaad04c2eed69aae81e836513d.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/3c1e1ecaad04c2eed69aae81e836513d.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/3c1e1ecaad04c2eed69aae81e836513d.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into breakneck, brutal gameplay where every move could be your last \u2013 or your key to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/b46681020869cdc65015a38512f28ae7.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/b46681020869cdc65015a38512f28ae7.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/b46681020869cdc65015a38512f28ae7.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rip through time with stylized mayhem, facing down the unique dangers and baddies of each twisted historical hotspot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/d2bb06e4a352655222fa9e602c059af7.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/d2bb06e4a352655222fa9e602c059af7.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/d2bb06e4a352655222fa9e602c059af7.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of 8 wild characters, each with their own madcap skills and playstyles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/f2fad9e03fafa47f0f7399de6de80158.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/f2fad9e03fafa47f0f7399de6de80158.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/f2fad9e03fafa47f0f7399de6de80158.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash chaos with devastating abilities like thunderous lightning, freezing ice blasts, and searing laser beams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/338f0862c5de20013382d78985fc55e7.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/338f0862c5de20013382d78985fc55e7.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/338f0862c5de20013382d78985fc55e7.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take on the robot elites in battles that will push your skills to the limit \u2013 and secure the crucial time keys.<br><br>Jump into the eye-popping, pixel-packed world of TimeFixers where vibrant visuals meet fast, frantic action. Explore ancient ruins, space-age cities, and everything in between as you carve your path through the chaos of time with dynamic animations and a killer aesthetic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/959efca0caaa731dd72c7d8683e6a5b9.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/959efca0caaa731dd72c7d8683e6a5b9.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/959efca0caaa731dd72c7d8683e6a5b9.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Strap in and blast through time in TimeFixers, a pulse-pounding roguelike where history\u2019s fate is in your hands. Rogue robots are wreaking havoc across the ages, and it\u2019s up to you to stop them before they tear the timeline to shreds.<br><br>As a TimeFixer, you\u2019re armed to the teeth with outrageous abilities and weapons, tearing through epochs from Ancient Egypt to a wild, futuristic cosmos. Smash through enemy hordes, topple ruthless robot overlords, and snag the vital time keys to stitch the timeline back together. With each run, face new challenges and power up in ways that\u2019ll keep you on your toes \u2013 no two runs are ever the same.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/3c1e1ecaad04c2eed69aae81e836513d.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/3c1e1ecaad04c2eed69aae81e836513d.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/3c1e1ecaad04c2eed69aae81e836513d.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into breakneck, brutal gameplay where every move could be your last \u2013 or your key to victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/b46681020869cdc65015a38512f28ae7.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/b46681020869cdc65015a38512f28ae7.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/b46681020869cdc65015a38512f28ae7.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rip through time with stylized mayhem, facing down the unique dangers and baddies of each twisted historical hotspot.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/d2bb06e4a352655222fa9e602c059af7.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/d2bb06e4a352655222fa9e602c059af7.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/d2bb06e4a352655222fa9e602c059af7.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the shoes of 8 wild characters, each with their own madcap skills and playstyles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/f2fad9e03fafa47f0f7399de6de80158.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/f2fad9e03fafa47f0f7399de6de80158.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/f2fad9e03fafa47f0f7399de6de80158.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash chaos with devastating abilities like thunderous lightning, freezing ice blasts, and searing laser beams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/338f0862c5de20013382d78985fc55e7.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/338f0862c5de20013382d78985fc55e7.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/338f0862c5de20013382d78985fc55e7.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Take on the robot elites in battles that will push your skills to the limit \u2013 and secure the crucial time keys.<br><br>Jump into the eye-popping, pixel-packed world of TimeFixers where vibrant visuals meet fast, frantic action. Explore ancient ruins, space-age cities, and everything in between as you carve your path through the chaos of time with dynamic animations and a killer aesthetic.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/959efca0caaa731dd72c7d8683e6a5b9.poster.avif?t=1740001146\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/959efca0caaa731dd72c7d8683e6a5b9.webm?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059790/extras/959efca0caaa731dd72c7d8683e6a5b9.mp4?t=1740001146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
